cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Numerical checks for: Beyond the baryon: one-loop spectra and closed-string vertices of general confining-string junctions"
authors:
  - family-names: Thakur
    given-names: Vishal Hiralal
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-8406-0508"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
Spectra, one-loop energies, O(R^-3) corrections, closed-string vertices and stability of confining-string junctions of arbitrary valence, tensions, directions and arm lengths, governed by a tension tensor. This repository reproduces every numerical statement in the associated manuscript.
repository-code: "https://github.com/vishal1601-2005/string-junction-checks"
